<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Belden Inc said raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Belden Inc said raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential raised its rating on Monday of Belden Inc to a hold from a buy, according to a Prudential source.</p>
<p>-- Belden shares closed at 32-1/8 on Friday.  </p>
<p>-- Prudential analyst Lisa Bogaty was not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street Desk 212-859-1730</p>
</text>
